<div xmlns:perseus="http://www.perseus.org/meta/perseus.rdfs#" xmlns:dctype="http://purl.org/dc/dcmitype/" xmlns:tufts="http://www.tufts.edu/" xmlns:alph="http://alpheios.net/namespaces/tei" class="alpheios-lex-text_container en">
    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n86727" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">προασπ-ίζω</span></b> , <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>A.</b><i>hold a shield before,</i>
			
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">τειχῶν</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Aristid.
					<u>Or.</u>
					26(14).84
				</span></i>
			; <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">τοῦ πατρός, τῆς Ῥωμαίων ἀρχῆς,</span>
			<i><span class="en">
				Philostr.
				<u>Her.</u>
				3.4
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				Hdn.
				6.2.5
			</span></i>; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ὅπλα π. λόγων</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Them.
					<u>Or.</u>
					16.200b
				</span></i>
			; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">κύνες π. τῶν δεσποτῶν</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Ph.
					2.200
				</span></i>
			: c. acc., <i>cover with a shield,</i>
			<i><span class="en">
				D.H.
				6.93
			</span></i>:—
				Pass.
			, <i>to be covered with shields,</i>
			<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">τοῖς ὁπλίταις</span> by them, <i><span class="en">
				Hld.
				9.14
			</span></i>. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense2"><b>II.</b>
			<i>put forward as a shield,</i>
			
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">τιϝὰ εἰς θώρακα</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Id.
					3.3
				</span></i>
			.</div>
